	Go back to that altar and sacrifice.  Don't forget to drop all
your items on the altar, as many people don't realize how useful they
can be for detecting blessings or curses on items.  I frequently take
as many wands of create monster as I can find when I return to an
altar, to max out my luck and possibly get a gift.  The first weapon
Valkyries get from Odin is always Mjollnir, which is quite a nice
weapon.  If you are wearing gauntlets of power and throw it, it does a
nice 'boomerang' effect.

