I found three in as many levels, and games where I only found one
before I reached the castle.  As for your sacrifices, that's just the
message Neutral and Chaotic characters get.  For a good giggle, try
offering a sacrifice while hallucinating.  ('Your sacrifice sprouts
wings and a propeller and roars away!  Odin seems fuzzy.')

